WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Crouching medium punch starts the conversion.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.000
OD Stribog launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.350
The medium-plus-heavy-punch OD Triglav pair continues the launch.

4
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.900
The live heavy-punch input activates Level 2.

5
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.750
Heavy Departure is placed while the Super supplies automatic hits.

6
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.150
JP jumps forward without a jumping attack, then dashes after landing.

7
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:07.900
Medium Stribog connects during the automatic hits.

8
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.000
A second medium Stribog extends the recorded route.

9
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.850
Heavy Departure is placed at the end.
